# Consolidated master dataset (build with: python consolidate_datasets.py)
#
# The Parquet IS committed on purpose: it is ~45 MB against ~80 MB for the CSV, and
# committing it lets Colab `git clone` the training data instead of re-uploading it
# every session. The source corpora are already tracked in this repo, so this adds no
# new class of content.
#
# The CSV stays out: it is the same table, nearly twice the size, and the trainer
# prefers the Parquet anyway (load_master_dataset falls back to CSV only when no
# Parquet engine is installed).
phishguard_master_dataset.csv


# master_dataset_manifest.json is intentionally tracked — it records which
# normalisation, PhiUSIIL policy and conflict policy produced the committed Parquet.
